ases magazine size\n  •  Increases reload speed\n  •  Decreases blast radius"}]},{"label":"Trait","weight":3,"perks":[{"name":"Auto-Loading Holster","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e4262099a1c2cea78b48a6680c5248c9.png","desc":"The holstered weapon is automatically reloaded after a short period of time."},{"name":"Ambitious Assassin","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/1f93b49c7f10b1be70083f913a3c5d63.png","desc":"Overflows the magazine based on the number of rapid kills before reloading."},{"name":"Snapshot Sights","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/ce16c9e2cbd73bb548af3e15bdfc7177.png","desc":"Faster time to aim down sights."},{"name":"Supercharged Magazine","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/b17b5725c96e59f838ae045b8433f8df.png","desc":"While amplified, ammo is gradually transferred from reserves to the magazine. \n\nWhile in Speed Booster, ammo regenerates faster and overflows the magazine."},{"name":"Envious Arsenal","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/234bcd9dc9f5e3ec850a8eac748afbde.png","desc":"Dealing damage with both other weapons before readying this weapon refills it from reserves."},{"name":"Eddy Current","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/e0f3c00a8b2cbccb8f1f1b318026aeee.png","desc":"Temporarily increases reload speed and handling after sprinting or while amplified. This effect is improved when you are amplified."},{"name":"Attrition Orbs","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c2092fae6ae58ca77a7f9b4434e688ef.png","desc":"Dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power."},{"name":"Rangefinder","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/74270d52bec24f1f5f4c987f5f37fce9.png","desc":"Aiming this weapon increases its effective range and zoom magnification. Increased projectile velocity while aiming Rocket Launchers, Grenade Launchers, and Bows."},{"name":"Field Prep","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/4ee1ecaead6fe2de1a2cab07f8b7be3f.png","desc":"Increases ammo generation. Faster reload, stow, and ready speed when you're crouching